// Cloud AI (DeepSeek) build-time configuration.
//
// This repository is PUBLIC, so the real API key lives in Secrets.local.xcconfig — gitignored,
// present only on the build machine. The optional include below quietly does nothing when that
// file is missing: the key resolves empty, `CloudAIConfig.isConfigured` reads false, and the
// app falls back to on-device AI (Apple Intelligence) exactly as it behaved before the cloud
// path existed. A fresh clone therefore always builds.
//
// The value flows: Secrets.local.xcconfig -> this build setting -> Info.plist (HCDeepSeekAPIKey,
// via $(HC_DEEPSEEK_API_KEY)) -> CloudAIConfig.current at runtime.
HC_DEEPSEEK_API_KEY =

#include? "Secrets.local.xcconfig"
